## **Step 2: API Key Paste Kar**

Notepad mein yeh likha:
```
OPENAI_API_KEY=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

**`your_api_key_here` ki jagah apna actual API key paste kar!**

### **Agar API key nahi hai toh:**

**Option 1: OpenAI (Paid - $5 free trial)**
1. https://platform.openai.com/api-keys par jao
2. Sign up / Login kar
3. "+ Create new secret key" click kar
4. Key copy kar
5. `.env` mein paste kar

**Option 2: Claude API (Anthropic - Free trial)**
1. https://console.anthropic.com/ par jao
2. API key generate kar
3. `.env` mein paste kar

**Option 3: Test karne ke liye (Dummy key)**
```
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-test-123456789